OL,3,GNEWSAAttacks victim's death
OL,4,A'potentially preventable'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe inquiry also heard documents found
OL,7,Fin a bin at Calocane's address
OL,8,Fcontained a list of explosives, which
OL,9,Fwas not disclosed by police until June
OL,10,Fthis year.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
